00:07:01,892 --> 00:07:03,899
saving a user. We're not using some

175
00:07:04,028 --> 00:07:06,244
low-level built-in API here.

176
00:07:07,095 --> 00:07:09,199
That's what levels of abstraction are about.

177
00:07:09,745 --> 00:07:12,041
We got high and low levels of abstraction

178
00:07:12,394 --> 00:07:14,209
