236
00:09:32,087 --> 00:09:34,160
Now, the message here is not that you should

237
00:09:34,176 --> 00:09:35,848
write high-level code only.

238
00:09:36,426 --> 00:09:38,612
Low-level code can also be quite

239
00:09:38,612 --> 00:09:41,007
